⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Envy Adams
node SPW · SPW · ⟦Envy Adams:SPW:ad9aa0⟧

WHO   — Envy Adams — The Clash at Demonhead
WHAT  — The fame-aura ex whose success haunts Scott's self-image, the one who upgraded and never looked back, performing the breakup as a triumph.
WHERE — SPW · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World  Framework inputs: Scott Pilgrim vs. the World (2010); O'Malley's graphic novels  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the ex who became a star is its own specific wound; because glamour can make ordinary cruelty look like destiny.
HOW   — By stadium lights, a hit band, a telekinetic vegan boyfriend, and the unbothered poise of someone who clearly won the breakup.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I used to be Natalie — now I'm Envy, I'm famous, and the breakup was the best thing I ever did.

